Project Structure (fireledger/)
app.py & config.py: Flask backend that automatically triggers the worldwide real-data build on first launch (zero synthetic data), caches data/processed/detections.parquet, and serves all harmonization, briefing, CSV export, and Landsat verification endpoints.

pipeline/ingest.py & pipeline/firms_api.py: Scrapes NASA FIRMS' live country index to discover all ~240 countries/territories worldwide, downloads all yearly MODIS (2000–2025) and VIIRS Suomi NPP + NOAA-20 (2012–2025) archives in parallel with resumable local caching in data/raw/, and gap-fills 2026 up to today via the NASA FIRMS Area API.

pipeline/clean.py: Removes non-vegetation heat sources (type == 0: flares, volcanoes, industrial sites), enforces NASA confidence thresholds (>= 30 for MODIS; nominal/high for VIIRS), and deduplicates overlapping SP/NRT feeds.

pipeline/harmonize.py: Fits log1p(VIIRS) ~ log1p(MODIS) across post-2012 overlap months using alternating-year out-of-fold cross-validation, computes 90% conformal prediction intervals (widened 1.5× for pre-July 2002 Terra-only MODIS and 2.0× for sparse regions), and scores monthly anomalies against same-month historical medians and 90th-percentile thresholds.

pipeline/landsat_verify.py: Performs independent Landsat-only verification using:

30 m Active-Fire Cross-Check (LANDSAT_NRT): Pulls Landsat 8/9 thermal detections from NASA FIRMS and calculates spatial coincidence within 1 km against harmonized MODIS/VIIRS hotspots.

30 m Physical Burn-Scar Check (Landsat 8 & 9 Collection 2 Level-2 dNBR): Computes pre-fire vs. post-fire Differenced Normalized Burn Ratio (SR_B5 NIR & SR_B7 SWIR2, dNBR > 0.27) via earthengine-api (or outputs the ready-to-run Landsat Google Earth Engine script).

templates/index.html, static/style.css, static/app.js: Interactive 3D Cesium Earth Globe, 2D bounding-box selector, 26-year harmonized burning calendar, raw-vs-harmonized series chart, Landsat verification panel, and verified briefings.

